  "summary": "Register the exact CC-010 three-corpus protocol boundary.",
  "why": "Every direct dependency is complete and exactly bound, so CC-010 may own only the six protocol-definition and validation files needed before independent source and oracle work. The card keeps candidate and worker ledger empty, starts no R stage, and excludes corpus content, compiler implementation, generated expectations, public API, packaging, Docker, and release work."
